Watchkeeper

The initial design and roadmap were adapted from the Watchkeeper planning
document developed in the ChemGraph project:
https://github.com/argonne-lcf/ChemGraph

ChemGraph is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Its project
metadata identifies Thang Pham and Murat Keçeli as maintainers, and Thang Pham,
Murat Keçeli, and Aditya Tanikanti as authors.

The Watchkeeper design was revised for this standalone repository on
2026-10-28. The package scaffold does not copy ChemGraph implementation code.
Future ports must retain applicable source notices and identify their origin.

The IRI target configuration contract and its test fixture follow
src/chemgraph/skills/iri-hpc/assets/target.example.toml and
src/chemgraph/skills/iri-hpc/scripts/iri_configure.py at ChemGraph commit
855e3756856e49aa4326937e552840acd5ebdaf9 (Apache-2.0). No ChemGraph implementation
code is imported or executed by the configuration loaders.
